{"id":"ec822a0f3a","t":"Return of the Runebound Professor","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/5a95208581c0b9fa6484233992e3e6bb-1-193x278.jpg","n":59,"l":59,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"return-of-the-runebound-professor"},"u":1795038064023,"desc":"كان ماجوس فيرميل حثالة – الأستاذ الأكثر كرهًا في أكاديمية السحر. ثم قتله شخص ما. لم يكن من الممكن أن يُسمع عنه مرة أخرى لولا روح ضائعة من الأرض تُدعى نوح فاينز. انتقل نوح إلى جسد فيرميل، ويتولى قوى الرجل الرونية وقائمة واسعة من الأعداء. هناك مشكلة واحدة فقط. يجب على نوح أن يعلم الفصل غدًا، وليس لديه أي فكرة عن السحر.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اكشن","سحر","شونين"],"src":{"ml":"return-of-the-runebound-professor"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"return-of-the-runebound-professor|/manga/return-of-the-runebound-professor/1/"},"2":{"ml":"return-of-the-runebound-professor|/manga/return-of-the-runebound-professor/2/"},"3":{"ml":"return-of-the-runebound-professor|/manga/return-of-the-runebound-professor/3/"},"4":{"ml":"return-of-the-runebound-professor|/manga/return-of-the-runebound-professor/4/"},"5":{"ml":"return-of-the-runebound-professor|/manga/return-of-the-runebound-professor/5/"},"6":{"ml":"return-of-the-runebound-professor|/manga/return-of-the-runebound-professor/6/"},"7":{"ml":"return-of-the-runebound-professor|/manga/return-of-the-runebound-professor/7/"},"8":{"ml":"return-of-the-runebound-professor|/manga/return-of-the-runebound-professor/8/"},"9":{"ml":"return-of-the-runebound-professor|/manga/return-of-the-runebound-professor/9/"},"10":{"ml":"return-of-the-runebound-professor|/manga/return-of-the-runebound-professor/10/"},"11":{"ml":"return-of-the-runebound-professor|/manga/return-of-the-runebound-professor/11/"},"12":{"ml":"return-of-the-runebound-professor|/manga/return-of-the-runebound-professor/12/"},"13":{"ml":"return-of-the-runebound-professor|/manga/return-of-the-runebound-professor/13/"},"14":{"ml":"return-of-the-runebound-professor|/manga/return-of-the-runebound-professor/14/"},"15":{"ml":"return-of-